00:38:30.600 --> 00:38:36.600
 The honest part is that there's only so much that you can do at the state level that we

00:38:36.600 --> 00:38:37.600
 can do at the municipal level.

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:41.600
 And we're eliminating the only people who really impact price.

00:38:41.600 --> 00:38:48.600
 And we are going through all of these hoops and really punishing cities that taking the

00:38:48.600 --> 00:38:51.600
 zoning away and handing it back to the state, what does that do?

00:38:51.600 --> 00:38:53.600
 It doesn't create an affordable product.

00:38:53.600 --> 00:38:54.600
