 I know we could bring in some outside resources.

03:27:42.160 --> 03:27:44.160
 We could bring in some state.

03:27:44.160 --> 03:27:46.160
 I've got access to some of those types of people.

03:27:46.160 --> 03:27:47.160
 Oh, yeah.

03:27:47.160 --> 03:27:48.160
 It does.

03:27:48.160 --> 03:27:49.160
 That could give us some really good insight.

