 I'll tell you something I talked to Jared about when we were talking about downtown.

03:51:21.160 --> 03:51:25.160
 You know what they do up in Soldier Hollow during the wintertime with the snow rides?

03:51:25.160 --> 03:51:33.160
 Like, "Look, we don't always have snow, but we could absolutely have our own rides that exist up along the foothills

03:51:33.160 --> 03:51:36.160
 that kind of go along the way and kind of come down through downtown."

03:51:36.160 --> 03:51:39.160
 It would be a tourism attraction.

03:51:39.160 --> 03:51:47.160
 Well, they have blankets and all that that you put on when you're on those rides.

03:51:47.160 --> 03:51:51.160
 When people come to the area, they're looking for things to do.

03:51:51.160 --> 03:51:58.160
 We want to have on our website the best SEO with the wagon ride and, you know, take a step back into the past.

03:51:58.160 --> 03:52:02.160
 So, like, what Mayor's saying is dead on.

