 That's all I'm going to say.

03:57:05.160 --> 03:57:09.160
 But just realize that there are entrepreneurs out there that are pursuing that.

03:57:09.160 --> 03:57:12.160
 And that's something that we can certainly capitalize.

03:57:12.160 --> 03:57:13.160
 Yeah.

03:57:13.160 --> 03:57:15.160
 Anyway, just something to consider.

03:57:15.160 --> 03:57:17.160
 That's everything I have on my list.

