04:05:36.160 --> 04:05:39.160
 I'm not comfortable creating every single one of these committees.

04:05:39.160 --> 04:05:40.160
 Right.

04:05:40.160 --> 04:05:41.160
 I think it's too many.

04:05:41.160 --> 04:05:42.160
